@startuml Sequence_Core_Live_Viva_Exam
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam DefaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam SequenceActorBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceActorBackgroundColor #eff6ff

title SEQUENCE 1 — LIVE VIVA EXAM & AI SCORING (CORE FLOW)

autonumber 1

actor "Student" as Student
participant "Web App\n(React)" as Web
participant "Backend API\n(ASP.NET Core)" as API
participant "Cloudflare R2\n(Audio Storage)" as R2
participant "AI Engine\n(Gemini)" as AI

Student -> Web: Enter Viva Room
Web -> API: Validate Session
API --> Web: Question & TTS Audio

Web -> Student: Play Question Audio
Student -> Web: Speak Voice Answer

Web -> API: Stream Audio Answer
API -> R2: Store Audio File
API -> AI: Transcribe & Grade via Rubric
AI --> API: Score & Feedback Breakdown
API --> Web: Result Saved (Pending Review)

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Exam_Setup
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam DefaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam SequenceActorBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceActorBackgroundColor #eff6ff

title SEQUENCE 2 — EXAM SETUP & ENROLLMENT (TEACHER & SYSTEM)

autonumber 1

actor "Teacher" as Teacher
participant "Web App\n(React)" as Web
participant "Backend API\n(ASP.NET Core)" as API
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Teacher -> Web: Upload Course Material (.md)
Web -> API: Import Curriculum
API -> DB: Save Questions & Rubrics

Teacher -> Web: Schedule Exam Session
Web -> API: Create Multi-Slot Session
API -> DB: Enroll Students & Assign Slots
API --> Web: Exam Session Ready

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Examiner_Review
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam DefaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam SequenceActorBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceActorBackgroundColor #eff6ff

title SEQUENCE 3 — AUDIT REVIEW & PUBLISHING (EXAMINER & STUDENT)

autonumber 1

actor "Examiner" as Examiner
participant "Web App\n(React)" as Web
participant "Backend API\n(ASP.NET Core)" as API
participant "Cloudflare R2\n(Audio Storage)" as R2
actor "Student" as Student

Examiner -> Web: Select Student Attempt
Web -> API: Request Result & Audio URL
API -> R2: Generate Secure Presigned URL
R2 --> Web: Stream Student Voice Recording

Examiner -> Web: Approve or Override Score
Web -> API: Publish Official Grade
API --> Web: Result Locked (PUBLISHED)

Student -> Web: View Official Score & Feedback

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Full_Lifecycle
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam DefaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam SequenceActorBorderColor #2563eb
skinparam SequenceActorBackgroundColor #eff6ff

title SEQUENCE 4 — FULL END-TO-END SYSTEM LIFECYCLE

autonumber 1

actor "Teacher" as Teacher
actor "Student" as Student
participant "Web App" as Web
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Cloudflare R2" as R2
participant "AI Engine" as AI
actor "Examiner" as Examiner

== 1. Exam Setup ==
Teacher -> Web: Create Exam & Schedule Slots
Web -> API: Save Setup & Enroll Students

== 2. Live Viva Examination ==
Student -> Web: Enter Room & Answer via Voice
Web -> API: Stream Audio Answer
API -> R2: Store Audio File
API -> AI: Transcribe & Grade via Rubric
AI --> API: Score & Feedback
API --> Web: Result Saved (Pending Review)

== 3. Examiner Review & Publish ==
Examiner -> Web: Listen to Audio & Review Score
Web -> API: Publish Final Result
Student -> Web: View Published Grade

@enduml

